    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Meticulously designed and thoughtfully upgraded by the current owners, this impressive home is presented in excellent condition throughout, leaving little for the new owners to do other than unpack and put their own stamp on it.\n\nAt the heart of the home is a wonderful extended open-plan kitchen, living and dining space, cleverly designed to create a versatile and sociable hub for everyday family life and entertaining alike. Bold pops of colour are beautifully complemented by natural flooring, while large sliding doors and strategically positioned rooflights flood the space with natural light, creating a bright, contemporary and welcoming environment. The result is a fabulous multi-purpose space that can effortlessly adapt to suit the needs of modern family living.\n\nUpstairs, there are three generously proportioned bedrooms, all beautifully finished with high-quality laminate flooring and built-in wardrobes. The main bedroom benefits from a stylish ensuite, while the main bathroom was completely transformed in 2023 with a stunning contemporary makeover. The converted attic provides an invaluable additional space, further enhancing the versatility and appeal of this already impressive home.\n\nOutside, the property continues to impress. The rear garden is neat and low maintenance, predominantly laid in lawn with a lovely Indian sandstone patio providing the perfect spot for outdoor dining and relaxation. To the front, there is off-street parking, with the added benefit of designated parking close by.\n\nKilvere Park, Cypress Downs is a mature and highly regarded development and is undoubtedly one of the most sought-after addresses in the Templeogue area. Exceptionally peaceful, the development enjoys attractive tree-lined streets where residents clearly take great pride in their surroundings, with beautifully maintained gardens and well-presented homes throughout.\n\nThe location is superbly positioned for families, with an excellent selection of schools within easy walking distance, including Templeogue College, Terenure College, Our Lady`s School and St. Pius X National School. The Orwell Shopping Centre is close by, as are St. Jude`s GAA Club and St. Mary`s Rugby Club.\n\nFor those who enjoy the great outdoors, both Bushy Park and Tymon Park are within easy reach, while Ashleaf and Rathfarnham Shopping Centres provide an excellent choice of shops and services. The villages of Terenure and Templeogue are also just a short drive away, offering a wonderful selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and everyday amenities.\n\nThe area is well served by a number of frequent and dependable bus routes, while the property also benefits from easy access to the M50 motorway network, making commuting throughout Dublin and beyond particularly convenient.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises: entrance hall, guest W.C., utility room, living room, open-plan kitchen/dining/living area, three bedrooms, ensuite, main bathroom and converted attic.\n\nAll in all, No. 2 Kilvere Park is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a stylish and exceptionally well-presented family home in one of Templeogue`s most desirable and peaceful settings. With its beautifully designed interior, excellent additional living space, converted attic and superb location close to an array of amenities and highly regarded schools, this is a home that is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\n\n"
      },
